glitchvape (0.01-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Split the typefaces across two binary packages: those whose terms this
    project can state ship in glitchvape, and W95FA -- whose licence is a
    font aggregator's description rather than a document -- ships in
    glitchvape-fonts-extra. See README.Debian for what an upload to Debian
    proper would need.
  * Bundle Departure Mono and Fusion Pixel under the OFL and VCR OSD Mono
    under its author's own grant, each with its licence text beside it.

 -- Kamil J. Dudek <kamilek@localhost.localdomain>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 23:00:00 +0200
